projects.description:
Led team of 5 aimed to fully support and coordinate the post-merger integration of 2 Russian energy majors’ IT functions (~ 17 000 ppl in scope across several business units of 2 companies). Managed workgroup of ~30 stakeholders across 2 companies:
- Development of general approach and integration plans for IT, target vision of IT-function and long-term key initiatives;
- Cross-stream coordination support with the business workgroups, integration HQ in order to monitor and identify the impact of changes to information systems;
- Provision of risk management facilities, problem management facilities, support for the development of synergy effects model for the IT area;
- Provision of communication support to IT-block during the integration;
- Methodological support and quality assurance in integration of IT-blocks;
- Support in developing of target organizational and operating models of IT-block.

*Awarded with a medal «for Valor during the Integration».
